and Ht is an pm  pn   mqq matrix. The process ϵt is an ppn   mq  1q vector of serially independent, identically
distributed disturbances with Erϵts  0 and V arpϵtq  I the identity matrix. We let the initial state vector α1 be
independent of ϵt at all time t. The ﬁrst equation is the observation or measurement equation, and the second equation
is transition equation. The general (ﬁrst-order Markov) state equation takes the form
αt  fpαt1, θt1q   ηt1
and the general observation equation takes the form
